----------------------------------------------------------------------

To house the high-capacity, `450mm` solid titanium piston rods and their corresponding `700mm` forged steel cylinders, the internal keel structure must feature precision-machined hydraulic anchoring pockets. This OpenSCAD script defines the spatial geometry parameters to cast these mounting points directly into the ship's structural bulkheads.

```
